# Color Conversions

A standalone package for converting various color systems to RGB.

## Supported Systems
- NCS
- RAL
- Profel
- DB (Deutsche Bahn)
- BS (British Standard)
- Granit

## Installation
```bash
pip install .
```
or with uv:
```bash
uv pip install .
```
